  "release_date": "2025-06-04T00:00:00Z",
  "updated": "2025-06-04T00:00:00Z",
  "description": "Galileo is a highly multimodal transformer model for remote sensing, capable of learning global and local features from diverse modalities (optical, SAR, elevation, weather, pseudo-labels, etc.) across space and time. It uses a dual self-supervised learning algorithm with global and local contrastive losses and is pretrained on a globally sampled, highly multimodal dataset. Galileo outperforms state-of-the-art specialist models on a wide range of remote sensing benchmarks.",
  "sci:doi": "10.48550/arXiv.2502.09356",
  "license": null,
